{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1709145389_7273851_1658ff0a09374940048d23584327704c.jpg",
  "description": "<h2 class=\"hero__title heading-size-7 aos-animate\" data-aos=\"hero\" data-aos-anchor=\"#BrickSection--template--22416239919392__image-with-text\" data-aos-order=\"1\">25 years and thousands of happy customers</h2>\r\n<div class=\"hero__rte body-size-3 columns--1 aos-animate\" data-aos=\"hero\" data-aos-anchor=\"#BrickSection--template--22416239919392__image-with-text\" data-aos-order=\"2\">\r\n<p>Celt Naturals has been selling supplements across North America and the UK for over 25 years. Our products are time tested and proven. And our Customers agree.</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"hero__title heading-size-9 aos-animate\" data-aos=\"hero\" data-aos-anchor=\"#Hero--template--22416239919392__hero\" data-aos-order=\"2\">Natural Ingredients</h2>\r\n<p class=\"hero__description body-size-5 font-body aos-animate\" data-aos=\"hero\" data-aos-anchor=\"#Hero--template--22416239919392__hero\" data-aos-order=\"3\">Only the best natural ingredients are in our patented formulas. All of our supplements are third party tested for quality.</p>\r\n<p class=\"hero__description body-size-5 font-body aos-animate\" data-aos=\"hero\" data-aos-anchor=\"#Hero--template--22416239919392__hero\" data-aos-order=\"3\"></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"hero__title heading-size-8 block-padding aos-animate\" data-aos=\"hero\" data-aos-anchor=\"#Rte--template--22416239919392__rich-text\" data-aos-order=\"1\">Health Canada's Role</h2>\r\n<div class=\"hero__rte body-size-3 font-body block-padding aos-animate\" data-aos=\"hero\" data-aos-anchor=\"#Rte--template--22416239919392__rich-text\" data-aos-order=\"2\">\r\n<p>The Natural Health Product Directorate of Health Canada is one of the world&rsquo;s leading Regulators of supplements. Many countries follow these protocols for reviewing and licencing natural health products (NHPs). The Regulations were created to ensure that Canada and other countries have ready access to NHPs that are safe, effective, and of high quality, while respecting freedom of choice, as well as philosophical and cultural diversity. Immuno-Care&reg;, by Celt Naturals, is a fully licenced and Regulated supplement, in accordance with Health Canada&rsquo;s Regulatory requirements.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
